<title>FINLAND: LANNEN TEHTAAT JAN-APR PROFIT UP 24 PCT.</title>
<headline>LANNEN TEHTAAT JAN-APR PROFIT UP 24 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April, 1997</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	   19.6 vs 15.8</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   2.16 vs 2.11</p>
<p> Net sales					  320.8 vs 267.8</p>
<p> Operating profit				  20.7 vs 13.3</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	30.9 vs 21.1</p>
<p> Depreciation					10.2 vs 7.8</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 1.1 vs 2.5 gain</p>
<p> Taxes						  5.6 vs 3.1</p>
<p> Minorities				  charge 0.1 vs 0.2 gain</p>
<p> Net profit					  13.9 vs 12.9</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)		60 vs 57</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish foodstuffs, animal feed abd</p>
<p>earthmoving technology group is Lannen Tehtaat Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
